OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 19 Oct to Wed 28 Oct
OL,6,FHigh pressure is expected to lie close
OL,7,Fto or across the UK through much of
OL,8,Fthis period. This likely to result in
OL,9,Fplenty of fine weather. Some rain is
OL,10,Fstill likely at times as more
OL,11,Funsettled conditions attempt to move
OL,12,Fin from the west or southwest at
OL,13,Ftimes. Overall, drier than normal
OL,14,Fconditions for the time of year are
OL,15,Fmore likely for most regions.
OL,16,FTemperatures generally around average,
OL,17,Fin more settled spells some night
OL,18,Ffrost and morning fog patches are
OL,19,Flikely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
