OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 28 Oct to Wed 11 Nov
OL,6,FHigh pressure will probably be
OL,7,Fdominant at first with many areas fine
OL,8,Fand dry. A transition to more
OL,9,Fchangeable or unsettled weather
OL,10,Fpatterns is expected during the first
OL,11,Fpart of November with showers or
OL,12,Flonger spells of rain becoming more
OL,13,Flikely. Temperatures are likely to be
OL,14,Fnear to or above normal for the period
OL,15,Fas a whole.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
